<decision #track.add-eidolon-workflow-runtime-run-tools.runtime-owner apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { status = "accepted" priority = "P0" } (
  <question ?01M05F1PNRGAC8CZGC5J8NFR67>
  Workflow runtime tools 是否创建独立 workflow run store？
  </?01M05F1PNRGAC8CZGC5J8NFR67>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M05F1PNRGAC8CZGC5J8NFR68>
    不创建。
    </?01M05F1PNRGAC8CZGC5J8NFR68>
    <decision-text ?01M05F1PNRGAC8CZGC5J8NFR69>
    首版 workflow run/status/events/result/resume 复用 detached actor registry 与 observability facts。
    </?01M05F1PNRGAC8CZGC5J8NFR69>
    <rationale ?01M05F1PNRGAC8CZGC5J8NFR6A>
    Mission 决策要求 workflow 自己只保存 workflow facts，runtime facts 由 Eidolon actor/session/runtime-control 体系拥有。
    </?01M05F1PNRGAC8CZGC5J8NFR6A>
    <evidence ?01M05F1PNRGAC8CZGC5J8NFR6B>
    mission decisions；design.md。
    </?01M05F1PNRGAC8CZGC5J8NFR6B>
  )>
)>
